# ==========================================================
# ARKOS Workspace — .gitignore
# ==========================================================

# ----------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party reference material (copyrighted, not ARKOS IP)
# ----------------------------------------------------------
# Standards/reference documents kept locally for consultation only —
# not redistributed via the repo. Cite them in docs, don't version them.
6 - IEEE_2024_SWEBOK_4.pdf
prints_benchmark/
*.pdf

# ----------------------------------------------------------
